Article 2 (Eligible Recipients) Clinical research expenses (hereinafter referred to as "research expenses") shall be paid to public officials belonging to the National Police Hospital who fall under any of the following and have been designated by the Director of the National Police Hospital as eligible recipients under Article 5:
1. Public officials of Grade V or higher in medical service occupational categories (including contract public officials holding equivalent positions);
2. Public officials of Grade V or higher in pharmaceutical service occupational categories.
